{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14213470","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14213470","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1421347001:1":{"text":"图纸复原之后，上面呈现出了矮人特色的古代符文，海拉光是看了一眼就面有难色。","source_cn":"图纸复原之后，上面呈现出了矮人特色的古代符文，海拉光是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D06E9BF7F79BD77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1421347002:1":{"text":"确实是之前丢掉的那份，这里的几个部分还是我破译的，但其他的我就看不懂了。","source_cn":"确实是之前丢掉的那份，这里的几个部分还是我破译的，但其...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x314B086A21A2E2EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421347003:1":{"text":"我知道，你是搞机械的，不学历史也不学古文是吧。","source_cn":"我知道，你是搞机械的，不学历史也不学古文是吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8029DB14690042F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421347004:1":{"text":"哈哈哈哈哈，看不懂了吧？愚蠢！只有像我这样能够举一反三，拥有无与伦比智慧与联想能力的矮人才能看懂！","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈哈，看不懂了吧？愚蠢！只有像我这样能够举一反三...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69BD8AB295EB8763","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421347005:1":{"text":"让我告诉你上面写着什么吧！","source_cn":"让我告诉你上面写着什么吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D5BAC697E8CAF2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421347006:1":{"text":"这就是：万里逐敌之弓！渊底流焰凝结之弓，伟大而闪耀的——","source_cn":"这就是：万里逐敌之弓！渊底流焰凝结之弓，伟大而闪耀的——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x419F3E710C6BA004","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421347007:1":{"text":"——<style=\"highlight\">杜恩加尔</style>。","source_cn":"——<style=highlight>杜恩加尔</st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A7F9EE8BB511E87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421347008:1":{"text":"杜恩——咳咳咳，你、你这个小丫头，你怎么认识？！","source_cn":"杜恩——咳咳咳，你、你这个小丫头，你怎么认识？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE2C0A591854E764","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1421347009:1":{"text":"我不但认识这些文字，还认识最下方的盖章——皇家大工程师许可与赫托认证。","source_cn":"我不但认识这些文字，还认识最下方的盖章——皇家大工程师...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A9C443211B2FDED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1421347010:1":{"text":"那是帝国时期的负责人吗？","source_cn":"那是帝国时期的负责人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09E248F61229394E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1421347011:1":{"text":"是的，帝国时期的矮人还没有这样明确的分工，很多人都是多面手。","source_cn":"是的，帝国时期的矮人还没有这样明确的分工，很多人都是多面手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06F871297D0406EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1421347012:1":{"text":"皇家大工程师并不只是工程师，而是能够把控材料、锻冶、能源供给、方案设计、落地修改、迭代改进等等内容的总负责人。","source_cn":"皇家大工程师并不只是工程师，而是能够把控材料、锻冶、能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8825ECAB525B202D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1421347013:1":{"text":"就像传说中赫托就是擅长矮人诸多技艺，无一不精的神明一样，大工程师就被誉为赫托的代行者。","source_cn":"就像传说中赫托就是擅长矮人诸多技艺，无一不精的神明一样...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62029B8AAB25EFEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1421347014:1":{"text":"能横跨这么多的学科，每一种都无比擅长……真的有这样的人吗，太了不起了。","source_cn":"能横跨这么多的学科，每一种都无比擅长……真的有这样的人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64A86DAAEF36F15A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1421347015:1":{"text":"这、这就是帝国的底蕴！现在的矮人，学了设计就不学材料，搞了锻冶就不做方案，完全退化了！！","source_cn":"这、这就是帝国的底蕴！现在的矮人，学了设计就不学材料，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16257A6ED54A785B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:142134