ale":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1421347021:1":{"text":"你、你说什么？这个伟大的工程师是，是你的祖先？","source_cn":"你、你说什么？这个伟大的工程师是，是你的祖先？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8862BCBC62FE5023","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1421347022:1":{"text":"是的，小丫头，我活得比你想象得久得多，也阅读过无数的史料与记载……","source_cn":"是的，小丫头，我活得比你想象得久得多，也阅读过无数的史...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EDC588A52108C78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1421347023:1":{"text":"在如今生者之中，或许我是距离你所向往的帝国兴盛与毁灭的最近的那一个见证者。","source_cn":"在如今生者之中，或许我是距离你所向往的帝国兴盛与毁灭的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4610D32C15E49402","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1421347024:1":{"text":"在海拉与伊娜目瞪口呆的注视下，祖娅认真地讲述了在萨洛克兰曾经对我们讲过的过往。","source_cn":"在海拉与伊娜目瞪口呆的注视下，祖娅认真地讲述了在萨洛克...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2598EAD8636847D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1421347025:1":{"text":"帝国的傲慢，赫托的变化，对无辜生命的贪婪与利用……","source_cn":"帝国的傲慢，赫托的变化，对无辜生命的贪婪与利用……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1C6155733B2701E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1421347026:1":{"text":"失去了敬畏，失去了人性，任由欲望如毒火般无穷无尽蔓延的钢心帝国，终究在龙的诅咒中，彻底坠落。","source_cn":"失去了敬畏，失去了人性，任由欲望如毒火般无穷无尽蔓延的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x935243CC850E8D77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1421347027:1":{"text":"……伊娜，看到你的样子，我就想起年轻时的我。","source_cn":"……伊娜，看到你的样子，我就想起年轻时的我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D471CA3610E67E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1421347028:1":{"text":"我那时没有喝下蛋液，正是你现在的年纪。我天真，聪明，而又傲慢。","source_cn":"我那时没有喝下蛋液，正是你现在的年纪。我天真，聪明，而...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DFB569A1D2C8208","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1421347029:1":{"text":"但，正因为我如此傲慢，我才无法接受，我一切的成果都建立在那罪恶不堪的基础之上。","source_cn":"但，正因为我如此傲慢，我才无法接受，我一切的成果都建立...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF22CD0E60FA872DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1421347030:1":{"text":"………………我……我……我从来没有想过……","source_cn":"………………我……我……我从来没有想过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CCF1CACB3A7CFFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document